@startuml
title Common Coordination Associations (Framework-Level)
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

class "StepCompositionAssociationCoordination" as SACC <<Contract>> {
  documentId: pipeline.step-composition.association-coordination.contract
}
class "StepCompositionInternalComponentLifecycleCoordination" as SILCC <<Contract>> {
  documentId: pipeline.step-composition.internal-component-lifecycle-coordination.contract
}
class "Association" as Assoc <<Entity>> {
  associationIdentity
  componentInstanceIdentity
  associationTargetIdentity
  stepInstanceIdentity
}
class "InvocationBinding" as IB <<Entity>> {
  selects association context
}
class "Component Instance Identity" as CII <<Concept>> {
  concrete runtime component instance
}
class "Component Association Identity" as CAI <<Concept>> {
  one relationship instance
}
class "Component Invocation Identity" as CIII <<Concept>> {
  one invocation/activity
}
class "Runtime Instance Lifetime" as RIL <<Lifetime>> { }
class "Association Lifetime" as AL <<Lifetime>> { }
class "Invocation Lifetime" as IL <<Lifetime>> { }
class "Operation Lifetime" as OL <<Lifetime>> { }
class "Step Composition" as SC <<Component>> {
  + association coordination authority
  + lifecycle coordination authority
}

SACC --> Assoc : governs relationships
SACC --> IB : governs invocation binding
SILCC --> RIL : defines milestones
SILCC --> AL : defines association lifetime
SILCC --> IL : defines invocation lifetime
SILCC --> OL : defines operation lifetime
SC .> SACC : owned by
SC .> SILCC : owned by
Assoc ..> CII : identifies component instance
Assoc ..> CAI : distinct relationship identity
Assoc ..> CIII : identifies invocation

note right of SACC : Commonality = pair of Step Composition responsibilities
All Association/Lifecycle specialization kept per pattern

@enduml